cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DIFFRUX (formerly Afruz PXRD Analyzer) in published work, cite the exact software version
  and the primary methodological references for the refinement methods used.
title: 'DIFFRUX: A Scientific Workbench for Powder X-ray Diffraction and Crystal Visualization'
type: software
